Put In Every CommentsAppleScript for iTunes 2Find more free AppleScriptsand info on writing your ownat Doug's AppleScriptshttp://www.malcolmadams.com/itunes/Enter text to be placed en masse in the "Comments" box of every track in the selected/active iTunes Playlist. The default text is the name of the current Playlist.I make no guarantees to this scripts effectiveness on your computer. This script is capable of making minor changes to data. If this makes you aprehensive please use copies of your files.My name is Doug Adamsdougadams@mac.com